{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"750","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. New Year and Hurry"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Limak is going to participate in a contest on the last day of the 2016. The contest will start at 20:00 and will last four hours, exactly until midnight. There will be "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" problems, sorted by difficulty, i.e. problem "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" is the easiest and problem "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" is the hardest. Limak knows it will take him "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"5·i"},{"kind":"text","text":" minutes to solve the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th problem."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Limak's friends organize a New Year's Eve party and Limak wants to be there at midnight or earlier. He needs "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" minutes to get there from his house, where he will participate in the contest first."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"How many problems can Limak solve if he wants to make it to the party?"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The only line of the input contains two integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n ≤ 10"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ k ≤ 240"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the number of the problems in the contest and the number of minutes Limak needs to get to the party from his house."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print one integer, denoting the maximum possible number of problems Limak can solve so that he could get to the party at midnight or earlier."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3 222\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4 190\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"7 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"7\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first sample, there are "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"},{"kind":"text","text":" problems and Limak needs "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"222"},{"kind":"text","text":" minutes to get to the party. The three problems require "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"5"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"10"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"15"},{"kind":"text","text":" minutes respectively. Limak can spend "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"5 + 10 = 15"},{"kind":"text","text":" minutes to solve first two problems. Then, at 20:15 he can leave his house to get to the party at 23:57 (after "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"222"},{"kind":"text","text":" minutes). In this scenario Limak would solve "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"},{"kind":"text","text":" problems. He doesn't have enough time to solve "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"},{"kind":"text","text":" problems so the answer is "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second sample, Limak can solve all "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"4"},{"kind":"text","text":" problems in "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"5 + 10 + 15 + 20 = 50"},{"kind":"text","text":" minutes. At 20:50 he will leave the house and go to the party. He will get there exactly at midnight."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third sample, Limak needs only "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" minute to get to the party. He has enough time to solve all "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"7"},{"kind":"text","text":" problems."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"750A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/750/problem/A"}